  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26联考）某公司人数是5的倍数，且超过千人。若按照每组4人分组，最后少3人；若按照每组3人分组，最后少2人；若按照每组2人分组，最后少1人。这个公司至少有多少人？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1015"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1025"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1035"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1045"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          14
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          8
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-01-p014.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（一） · 实战精刷1 · 讲义第8页",
            "pdfPage": 14
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把“最后少几人”写清。4人分组少3人、3人分组少2人、2人分组少1人，都说明总数除以相应人数余1。于是总数减1是12的倍数，同时总数又是5的倍数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "N\\equiv1\\pmod{12},\\quad N\\equiv0\\pmod5\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad N=60k+25"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "1000以下最近的同类数是985，下一个就是1045，因此超过千人的最小值为1045，选D。核验1045+3、1045+2、1045+1分别能被4、3、2整除。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "余数与缺数相加等于除数；多个条件可合并成周期筛选。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
