    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26国考）甲、乙和丙3个单位共有100多名职工，其中甲单位的职工人数占总数的24%，乙单位的职工比丙单位多50%。问丙单位的职工比甲单位多多少人？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "4"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "8"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "12"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "16"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          14
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          8
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-03-p014.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（一） · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第8页",
            "pdfPage": 14
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把三单位人数统一成比例。甲占6/25，剩下乙丙占19/25；乙比丙多50%，即乙∶丙=3∶2。为让份数都是整数，把总量看成125份，得到甲∶乙∶丙=30∶57∶38。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "N=125k,\\qquad100<N<200\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad k=1"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以丙38人、甲30人，相差8人，选B。这里比例已经最简，整数人数保证总数是125的整数倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "部分占整体的比例与部分之间的比例结合时，先统一总份数。"
        }
      ],
