    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-04-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第4题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-04",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26天津）有甲、乙两个仓库均存放一些新款车和旧款车，两个仓库汽车总数之比为7：4。甲仓库的新款车占30%，乙仓库新款车占90%。若两个仓库汽车总数有300多辆，问甲仓库的旧款车比乙仓库多多少辆？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "120"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "124"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "130"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "135"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          15
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          9
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-04-p015.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（一） · 实战精刷4 · 讲义第9页",
            "pdfPage": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-04-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-04",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设甲、乙仓库总数分别7k、4k。甲新车2.1k辆、乙新车3.6k辆都必须为整数，所以k是10的倍数。总数11k是300多辆，只能取k=30。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "甲旧车=7\\times30\\times70\\%=147,\\quad乙旧车=4\\times30\\times10\\%=12"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "相差147-12=135辆，所以选D。别把“新款占比”直接拿来回答旧车差量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "连比中的份数也受各部分整数条件约束，先把最小整数单位放大。"
        }
      ],
